{
  "sn24.5:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 24.5 ",
  "sn24.5:0.2": "1. Sotāpattivagga ",
  "sn24.5:0.3": "Natthidinnasutta ",
  "sn24.5:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn24.5:1.2": "“Kismiṁ nu kho, bhikkhave, sati kiṁ upādāya, kiṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
  "sn24.5:1.3": "‘natthi dinnaṁ, natthi yiṭṭhaṁ, natthi hutaṁ, natthi sukatadukkaṭānaṁ kammānaṁ phalaṁ vipāko; natthi ayaṁ loko, natthi paro loko, natthi mātā, natthi pitā, natthi sattā opapātikā; natthi loke samaṇabrāhmaṇā sammaggatā sammāpaṭipannā ye imañca lokaṁ parañca lokaṁ sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā pavedenti. ",
  "sn24.5:1.4": "Cātumahābhūtiko ayaṁ puriso yadā kālaṁ karoti pathavī pathavīkāyaṁ anupeti anupagacchati, āpo āpokāyaṁ anupeti anupagacchati, tejo tejokāyaṁ anupeti anupagacchati, vāyo vāyokāyaṁ anupeti anupagacchati. ",
  "sn24.5:1.5": "Ākāsaṁ indriyāni saṅkamanti. ",
  "sn24.5:1.6": "Āsandipañcamā purisā mataṁ ādāya gacchanti. ",
  "sn24.5:1.7": "Yāva āḷāhanā padāni paññāyanti. ",
  "sn24.5:1.8": "Kāpotakāni aṭṭhīni bhavanti. ",
  "sn24.5:1.9": "Bhassantā āhutiyo. ",
  "sn24.5:1.10": "Dattupaññattaṁ yadidaṁ dānaṁ. ",
  "sn24.5:1.11": "Tesaṁ tucchaṁ musā vilāpo ye keci atthikavādaṁ vadanti. ",
  "sn24.5:1.12": "Bāle ca paṇḍite ca kāyassa bhedā ucchijjanti vinassanti na honti paraṁ maraṇā’”ti? ",
  "sn24.5:1.13": "“Bhagavaṁmūlakā no, bhante, dhammā …pe… ",
  "sn